 ('strong_cyp3a4_or_ugt1a9_interaction','Strong CYP3A4 inhibitor/inducer or strong UGT1A9 inhibitor present','consultant_review','Avoid strong CYP3A4 inhibitors/inducers and strong UGT1A9 inhibitors; reconcile all prescriptions, OTC/herbal products and grapefruit with oncology pharmacy before administration.',7),
